id: pm-071wg4
title: Release preparation omits the calendar date and fails post-tag main CI
description: Auto Release commits an undated calendar release heading before the immutable tag exists. After tagging canonical generation adds its date and main CI fails changelog drift checking. Pass the target calendar-version date to the package-owned generator before tagging. This distinct preparation boundary preserves the shipped exact-tag guard in pm-e63v1x.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-06T19:36:25.256Z"
