completed_at: "2026-09-06T19:47:48.836Z"
author: "harness:codex"
parent: pm-e70zh5
severity: high
environment: Auto Release preparation and post-tag main CI
repro_steps: Prepare a calendar release before its tag exists; create the matching tag; canonical changelog generation adds the missing date.
resolution: Release preparation passes --date-from-version to the package-owned generator so committed headings already match canonical post-tag output.
expected_result: Pre-tag and post-tag changelogs are byte-identical for a same-day calendar release.
actual_result: "183 focused tests pass, the actual published-generator fixture proves byte equality, full coverage passed 8506 tests, and static quality passed. Historical exact-tag release attribution is preserved separately. Graph-composition also passes with all cited discovery inputs represented as typed relationships."
affected_version: 2026.9.6
component: release-automation
regression: true
